  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0\n\n    NEW:\n    - Added optional HTTP-layer caching\n    - Added in-memory and distributed cache support\n    - Added configurable cache expiration policies\n\n    BREAKING:\n    - AddD3lg4doMaps* => AddDelgadoMaps*\n    - Configuration now uses the IOptions pattern\n    - Request timeout changed: int => TimeSpan\n\n    IMPROVEMENTS:\n    - Added .NET analyzers support\n    - Improved SDK consistency and extensibility\n\n    NOTES:\n    - HTTP caching does not apply to stream endpoints\n      like ComputeRouteMatrix (Distance Matrix)\n\n    Migration guide:\n    https://jsebas-11.github.io/D3lg4doMaps/docs/migration/v3",
